{"book":"kinney","chapter":"full-stack-typescript","chapterTitle":"TypeScript للويب الكامل","slug":"type-safe-routes-in-express","title":"المسارات الآمنة الأنواع في Express","headings":[],"html":"<p>من قيود Express أن مسارات الطرق ليست سوى نصوص، ولا تُفحص مقابل أنواع المعاملات. ويمكننا بناء موجّه آمن الأنواع:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> route&lt;\n  P <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">extends</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Record</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>, <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>&gt; = {},\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ResBody</span> = <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReqBody</span> = <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">any</span>,\n  <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReqQuery</span> = qs.<span class=\"hljs-property\">ParsedQs</span>,\n&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-attr\">path</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>, …<span class=\"hljs-attr\">handlers</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">RequestHandler</span>&lt;P, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ResBody</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReqBody</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">ReqQuery</span>&gt;&gt;) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> { path, handlers };\n}\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> userRoutes = [\n  route&lt;{ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserResponse</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/users/:id&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">req, res</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> userId = req.<span class=\"hljs-property\">params</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">id</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// …</span>\n  }),\n  route&lt;{}, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserResponse</span>[], {}, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">query</span>?: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span> }&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;/users&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">req, res</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> searchQuery = req.<span class=\"hljs-property\">query</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">query</span>;\n    <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// …</span>\n  }),\n];\n</code></pre>\n<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\">userRoutes.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">forEach</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">{ path, handlers }</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  app.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">get</span>(path, …handlers);\n});\n</code></pre>\n<p>ومع أن هذا لا يتحقق من أن <code>:id</code> في المسار يقابل <code>id</code> في نوع معاملاتك، فإنه يضمن أن تستقبل المعالجات طلبات محدّدة الأنواع تحديدًا سليمًا.</p>\n"}